      <S N="ReleaseNotes">6.1.18_x000D__x000A_New-BcContainer: Wait for the Docker service to become ready (poll up to 120 seconds) instead of failing immediately with "Docker service is not yet ready" when the daemon is still starting up (e.g. on CI runners). The RunTests workflow also waits for Docker before running the Windows test jobs._x000D__x000A_Fix Run-ALPipeline ignoring installed apps and country when installing missing test app dependencies with useCompilerFolder_x000D__x000A_Fix Run-ALPipeline not publishing test app dependencies before publishing the test app with useCompilerFolder_x000D__x000A_Fix assignPremiumPlan for BC29 containers at container creation_x000D__x000A_Issue 4186 Backup-BcContainerDatabases fails on BC29 multitenant containers ('The tenant ''tenant'' is not mounted or does not exist.')</S>
